    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d549-a1">

                <pb facs="0673" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg565"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 72—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Marquis de Vega de Armijo to Mr.
                    Snowden.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of
                            State</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">Palace</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January 24, 1893</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: The Government of His Majesty,
                    wishing to give an expression of its especial regard for the United States, has
                    agreed to offer for the acceptance of that Government the caravel <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Santa Maria</hi>, a reproduction of the one used by
                    Columbus in his discovery of the New World.</p>
                <p>No other than the great American nation can so worthily assume the duty of
                    preserving as an object of historic interest the above-mentioned vessel. This,
                    with the other two models of the <hi rendition="#italic">Nina</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Pinta</hi>, will remain as a precious souvenir of that
                    unparalleled and memorable expedition.</p>
                <p>Whilst informing your excellency of the action of His Majesty’s Government, it is
                    very pleasant to me to reiterate the assurances of my most distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">The Marquis de la Vega de
                        Armijo.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
